{#
| Variable         | Type    | Description                     |
|------------------|---------|---------------------------------|
| cart             | object  |                                 |
| cart.items_count | int     |                                 |
| cart.total       | string  | Formatted total ex: "١٠٠ ر.س"   |

ATARA header (redesign v3/v4):
  mobile  → hamburger · logo · cart, with the search field visible below the bar
  desktop → logo · search · wishlist · account · cart, then the 7-entry main menu
The menu itself is the merchant's main menu (admin → القوائم). Keep it to the
seven approved entries: شراشف الصلاة · سجاجيد الصلاة · الأزياء · الطرح والإكسسوارات · الأطياب · الهدايا · العروض
#}
<header data-testid="store-header" class="store-header">
  <div class="lg:hidden">
    <salla-bullet-delivery-tag></salla-bullet-delivery-tag>
  </div>

  <div id="mainnav" class="main-nav-container bg-white">
    <div class="inner bg-inherit w-full">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="at-header-bar">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
            <a data-testid="store-header-mobile-toggle" class="lg:hidden mburger mburger--collapse at-iconbtn" href="#mobile-menu" aria-label="Open-menu">
              <i class="sicon-menu"></i>
            </a>
            <a data-testid="store-header-logo" class="navbar-brand at-logo" href="{{ store.url }}">
              <img fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" src="{{ store.logo|cdn(300) }}" alt="{{ store.name }} logo">
              {% if is_page('index') %}
                <h1 class="sr-only">{{ store.name }}</h1>
              {% else %}
                <h2 class="sr-only">{{ store.name }}</h2>
              {% endif %}
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="at-header-search hidden lg:block">
            <salla-search data-testid="store-header-search" inline oval height="46"></salla-search>
          </div>

          <div class="at-header-actions">
            {% if store.settings.is_multilingual or store.settings.currencies_enabled %}
              <div class="hidden lg:block"><salla-localization-modal data-testid="store-header-localization" show-trigger></salla-localization-modal></div>
            {% endif %}
            <a class="at-iconbtn hidden lg:inline-flex" href="{{ link('customer/wishlist') }}" aria-label="{{ trans('blocks.header.wishlist') }}"><i class="sicon-heart"></i></a>
            <div class="hidden lg:block">
              <salla-user-menu data-testid="store-header-user-menu" avatar-only show-header show-trigger></salla-user-menu>
            </div>
            <salla-cart-summary data-testid="store-header-cart" class="at-iconbtn">
              <i slot="icon" class="header-btn__icon icon sicon-shopping-bag"></i>
            </salla-cart-summary>
          </div>
        </div>

        {# Mobile: visible search field under the bar #}
        <div class="at-mobile-search lg:hidden pb-3">
          <salla-search data-testid="store-header-search-mobile" inline oval height="46"></salla-search>
        </div>
      </div>

      {# Desktop main menu — 7 entries, dropdowns for grouped categories.
         Lives inside .inner so Raed's sticky-header height calc and pinning include it. #}
      <nav class="at-nav" aria-label="main">
        <div class="container">
          <custom-main-menu></custom-main-menu>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>

  </div>
</header>
